{{!
    @template tool_vae/positioning_section

    The positionings of the structure in the dossier. Either the whole section: its heading, the sentence that says a
    positioning is not a validation, the way to the self-positioning of the vaeiste, the archive of the structure, then for
    each record its code and its parts (a bloc with its certification, the lines of the record it replaces, the vaeiste's
    own level and its links, then the list of its competencies; or the competencies that stand alone). Or, when no record is
    left, the archive of the structure alone in the section. Or nothing. The parts touch: the template holds on one logical
    line, each break carried by a comment.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\positioning_section. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except two keys:
    * structurehtml - the archive of the structure, drawn by the template tool_vae/positioning_structure
    * linehtml - the line that stands on a bloc or a competency, drawn by the template tool_vae/positioning_line

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * bare - object or null: structurehtml, the archive of the structure alone
    * full - object or null: heading, disclaimer, selfposurl, selfposlink, structurehtml, records
    * records - array of {code, parts}
    * parts - array of {bloc, items}: bloc is null for the competencies that stand alone
    * bloc - object: heading, none (object: text, or null), linehtml, expired (object: torenew, text, or null), stale (object:
      text, or null), older (array of {text}), selfpos (object: text, or null), links (array of {sep, url, label})
    * items - array of {label, gone, none, linehtml, older, selfpos, links}: a competency; gone and none are objects (text)
      or null

    Example context (json):
    {
        "bare": null,
        "full": {
            "heading": "Positioning of the structure",
            "disclaimer": "It is not a validation: only the jury validates, outside this platform.",
            "selfposurl": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/selfposition.php?userid=7",
            "selfposlink": "Read the self-positioning of the vaeiste",
            "structurehtml": "<p>Archive of the structure in place.</p>",
            "records": [{
                "code": "RNCP100",
                "parts": [
                    {
                        "bloc": {
                            "heading": "Bloc - Bloc 1",
                            "none": null,
                            "linehtml": "<div class=\"ms-3 mb-2\">certified by the structure</div>",
                            "expired": {"torenew": "To renew", "text": "The certification stood until 2020-06-30."},
                            "stale": {"text": "A competency of the bloc was evaluated after the certification."},
                            "older": [{"text": "On the earlier record RNCP90 (BC01): certified by the structure, 2020-01-15"}],
                            "selfpos": {"text": "Self-positioning of the vaeiste: I act on my own, 4 November 2026"},
                            "links": [
                                {"sep": false, "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/certify.php?userid=7", "label": "Renew"},
                                {"sep": true, "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/certify.php?userid=7", "label": "History"}
                            ]
                        },
                        "items": [{
                            "label": "Competence C01",
                            "gone": {"text": "no longer in the record"},
                            "none": {"text": "Not positioned yet"},
                            "linehtml": "",
                            "older": [],
                            "selfpos": null,
                            "links": [{"sep": false, "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/evaluate.php", "label": "History"}]
                        }]
                    },
                    {"bloc": null, "items": []}
                ]
            }]
        }
    }
}}
{{#bare}}<section class="tool-vae-positioning mb-4">{{{structurehtml}}}</section>{{/bare}}{{!
}}{{#full}}<section class="tool-vae-positioning mb-4"><h3>{{heading}}</h3><p class="text-muted small">{{disclaimer}}</p>{{!
}}<p class="small"><a href="{{selfposurl}}">{{selfposlink}}</a></p>{{{structurehtml}}}{{!
}}{{#records}}<h4 class="h5">{{code}}</h4>{{!
}}{{#parts}}{{!
}}{{#bloc}}<h5 class="h6">{{heading}}</h5>{{!
}}{{#none}}<p class="text-muted">{{text}}</p>{{/none}}{{{linehtml}}}{{!
}}{{#expired}}<div class="alert alert-secondary small"><strong>{{torenew}}</strong> : {{text}}</div>{{/expired}}{{!
}}{{#stale}}<div class="alert alert-warning small">{{text}}</div>{{/stale}}{{!
}}{{#older}}<div class="small text-muted ms-3">{{text}}</div>{{/older}}{{!
}}{{#selfpos}}<div class="small text-muted ms-3 tool-vae-selfpos-line">{{text}}</div>{{/selfpos}}{{!
}}<p class="small">{{#links}}{{#sep}} | {{/sep}}<a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>{{/links}}</p>{{/bloc}}{{!
}}<ul class="list-unstyled ms-3">{{#items}}<li><strong>{{label}}</strong>{{!
}}{{#gone}} <span class="small text-muted">{{text}}</span>{{/gone}}{{#none}} - {{text}}{{/none}}{{{linehtml}}}{{!
}}{{#older}}<div class="small text-muted ms-3">{{text}}</div>{{/older}}{{!
}}{{#selfpos}}<div class="small text-muted ms-3 tool-vae-selfpos-line">{{text}}</div>{{/selfpos}}{{!
}}<span class="small"> {{#links}}{{#sep}} | {{/sep}}<a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>{{/links}}</span></li>{{/items}}</ul>{{!
}}{{/parts}}{{/records}}</section>{{/full}}
